{"type":"assistant","uuid":"f856d398-0694-44e1-b665-0d0cf1a68f94","session_id":"13c061ab-458d-404f-9d5d-caa688794da3","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"f856d398-0694-44e1-b665-0d0cf1a68f94","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The build succeeds. Let me create a comprehensive summary of the patch.\n\n## Summary of Changes\n\n### Bug Description\nThe \"Copy Url\" feature produced invalid, duplicated URLs like:\n```\nhttps://www.youtube.com/https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCKvfzCyVQPe2IYg4PkugvWQ\n```\n\n### Root Cause\nIn three locations, `YouTubeChannel` objects were being created with a full uploader URL (e.g., `https://www.youtube.com/channel/XXX`) instead of just the channel ID. When `getChannelUrl()` was called, it passed this full URL to `YoutubeChannelLinkHandlerFactory.getInstance().getUrl(getId())`, which then constructed a malformed URL by prepending `https://www.youtube.com/` to an already-absolute URL.\n\n### Files Modified\n\n**1. `app/src/main/java/free/rm/skytube/businessobjects/YouTube/newpipe/NewPipeService.java`**\n- Added `getChannelIdFromUrl(String uploaderUrl)` helper method that extracts the channel ID from a full channel URL using `streamingService.getChannelLHFactory().getId()`\n- Modified `getDetails()` to call this helper instead of passing `extractor.getUploaderUrl()` directly\n\n**2. `app/src/main/java/free/rm/skytube/businessobjects/YouTube/newpipe/VideoPager.java`**\n- Added `getChannelId(String uploaderUrl)` helper method that extracts the channel ID using the existing `channelLinkHandler`\n- Modified `convert()` to call this helper instead of passing `item.getUploaderUrl()` directly\n\n**3. `app/src/main/java/free/rm/skytube/businessobjects/YouTube/newpipe/VideoPagerWithChannel.java`**\n- Added `getChannelId(String uploaderUrl)` helper method (same approach as VideoPager)\n- Modified `convert()` to call this helper instead of passing `item.getUploaderUrl()` directly\n\n### Key Code Change Pattern\n```java\n// Before (buggy):\nnew YouTubeChannel(extractor.getUploaderUrl(), extractor.getUploaderName())\n\n// After (fixed):\nString channelId = getChannelIdFromUrl(extractor.getUploaderUrl());\nnew YouTubeChannel(channelId, extractor.getUploaderName())\n```\n\nThe `getChannelIdFromUrl` / `getChannelId` methods use NewPipe's `ChannelLinkHandlerFactory.getId()` to properly extract the raw channel ID from any URL format (e.g., `https://www.youtube.com/channel/XXX`, `channel/XXX`, or raw `XXX`)."}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":101573,"output_tokens":552,"cache_read_input_tokens":100320,"total_tokens":102125}}}
